This directory contains some Python documentation for the Amiga port.

The Amiga subdirectory contains Amiga specific documentation.  It is
important to read these documents because they contain vital notes and
tips!

NEWS summarises what changed between Python 2.0-era AmigaPython and this
2.7.18 distribution.  Full language/library documentation is the official
Python 2.7 docs at https://docs.python.org/2.7/
